  "content": "\n\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Aimz - Avowed RPG 准星</span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">简介</span></p>\n<p>为我的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a> 整合包定制的准星。现已作为独立内容发布。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">描述</span></p>\n<p>通过将原版标准准星替换为基于《Avowed》RPG 游戏的 RPG/PVP 风格准星，进一步提升你的原版游戏体验。非常适合在 RPG 或 PVP 环境中使用，在单人模式或普通服务器中也能正常工作。</p>\n<p><br>想要更多准星、字体或资源包？查看我的其他项目 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/gamerpotion/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击这里</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1098/243/2025-02-16_00-26-35-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1009\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即获取服务器，与好友一起畅玩！点击&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a>或下方横幅，并使用优惠码 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 立享 25% 折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
